WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
We want to believe that today was just a misunderstanding

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,000
you didn't mean it

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,140
But you have to do it in front of all the teachers and students in the school

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,860
Apologize publicly to Tingting

5
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:12,290
We can not hold you responsible

6
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:14,930
But we don't want to take the blame for a thief

7
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:18,070
can you do it

8
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,270
When I'm rough tomorrow

9
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:20,830
Go to the school radio room to apologize to her

10
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:22,350
In front of the whole school teachers and students

11
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,580
I see that Tingting suffered a lot of grievances today.

12
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,820
I want to ask for a leave for her

13
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,020
Wait until her mood stabilizes before sending her back to class.

14
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:38,660
Let’s go home Tingting

15
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,990
Begin the queue

16
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:49,300
You didn't do anything wrong. Why are you hiding?

17
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,580
I'll take Tingting home first

18
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,500
are you in a hurry

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,060
If there is an emergency, ask Tingting to get off the car first

20
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,770
I'll take you there first

21
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:56,370
What's going on in your head

22
00:00:56,370 --> 00:00:57,610
Your sister has suffered so much injustice

23
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:58,970
You let her go home alone

24
00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:03,020
What time is it now?

25
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,940
Let’s find a place to eat first. Let’s go to the China World Trade Center first.

26
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:22,300
I'm going to buy something, sister-in-law

27
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:23,730
Chen Yundong

28
00:01:23,730 --> 00:01:24,770
You wait in the car

29
00:01:24,770 --> 00:01:26,410
Just don't follow me up there.

30
00:01:26,410 --> 00:01:28,450
I'm going to buy something for women

31
00:01:28,450 --> 00:01:30,290
It's not appropriate for you to go with a man.

32
00:01:30,290 --> 00:01:32,010
Tingting, just follow me and go shopping.

33
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:33,170
I'm following you

34
00:01:33,170 --> 00:01:35,000
Just wait for you outside

35
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,160
Are you annoyed?

36
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:38,590
Why do you follow me when I buy things for women?

37
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:41,600
How about you help me buy it?

38
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:43,280
Why don't you speak anymore?
